          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most people, the best portable blender is the Ninja Blast: a cordless motor that copes with normal frozen-fruit smoothies, a lid you can drink from, and USB-C charging that works with any cable you already carry. Step up to the Blast Max for bigger or thicker drinks, choose the BlendJet 2 for compactness, and pick the Cuisinart EvolutionX if you want a cordless hand blender that also cooks.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
